# Graphify

This repo has a code graph in `graphify-out/`.

- Architecture / “where is X” questions: read `graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md` first, then `graphify query "..."`.
- After large edits to `app/` or `routes/`, rebuild with `/graphify app --update`.
- Open `graphify-out/graph.html` in a browser for the interactive map.
- Do not commit `graphify-out/`.
